<title>POLAND: WBK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 15 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 15 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 14.99 vs   13.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   23.71 vs   21.55</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 42.84 vs   36.63</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	79.66 vs   63.89</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 51.49 vs   51.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   80.35 vs   78.67</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		156.88 vs  141.38</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     301.72 vs  258.41</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
